{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38621","headline":"华州牓寄诸门生 · 薛昭纬","name":"华州牓寄诸门生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时君过听委平衡，粉署华灯到晓明。\n开卷固难窥浩汗，执衡空欲慕公平。\n机云笔舌临文健，沈宋章篇发咏清。\n自笑观光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛昭纬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38621.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38621","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}